/S /H4
/T (The Bachelor of Science in Accounting program offers a comprehensive and modern education designed to prepare students for successful careers in the dynamic accounting field. Accredited by prestigious bodies such as AACSB, ACCA, and IMA, the program combines rigorous academic training with practical, real-world applications to ensure graduates are well-equipped to meet industry demands.)
/E (The Bachelor of Science in Accounting program offers a comprehensive and modern education designed to prepare students for successful careers in the dynamic accounting field. Accredited by prestigious bodies such as AACSB, ACCA, and IMA, the program combines rigorous academic training with practical, real-world applications to ensure graduates are well-equipped to meet industry demands.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
